mermaid.decision:
flowchart TD
  Pain[Slow report, sharing job, or related list] --> Q1{Is one user over 10,000 owners or one parent over 10,000 children?}
  Q1 -->|Yes owner| Dist[Distribute ownership; avoid moving that user in roles or sharing-rule groups]
  Q1 -->|Yes parent| Split[Reduce children per parent; stop dummy-account parking]
  Q1 -->|No| Q2{Are filters selective and index-friendly?}
  Q2 -->|No| Sel[Narrow filters; drop negative and non-indexable patterns]
  Q2 -->|Yes| Q3{Is active data still growing without archive?}
  Q3 -->|Yes| Arch[Archive or tier at inbound rate; empty Recycle Bin / hard delete when appropriate]
  Q3 -->|No| Next[Consider Support-assisted options; do not invent a million-row cutoff]
